WEBVTT

00:09:28.484 --> 00:09:30.507
and now that I'm directing
you in this way,

00:09:30.531 --> 00:09:32.053
everything will be okay."

00:09:32.077 --> 00:09:34.752
But if you understood
how important meaning is,

00:09:34.776 --> 00:09:37.354
then you would figure out
that it's actually important

00:09:37.378 --> 00:09:39.172
to spend some time, energy and effort

00:09:39.196 --> 00:09:42.100
in getting people to care more
about what they're doing.

00:09:43.322 --> 00:09:45.433
The next experiment
was slightly different.

00:09:45.457 --> 00:09:48.092
We took a sheet of paper
with random letters,

00:09:48.116 --> 00:09:50.203
and we asked people
to find pairs of letters

00:09:50.227 --> 00:09:52.258
that were identical next to each other.

00:09:52.282 --> 00:09:53.442
That was the task.

00:09:53.466 --> 00:09:54.870
People did the first sheet,

00:09:54.894 --> 00:09:58.239
then we asked if they wanted to do
another for a little less money,

00:09:58.263 --> 00:10:01.139
the next sheet for a little bit
less, and so on and so forth.